@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<section style="padding: 40px 24px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; color:#111827;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p style="margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
        BenLan Management System ("BenLan", "we", "us", or "our") protects the personal information used to provide bus transportation booking services in Cambodia.
        This policy explains what we collect, how we use it, and how customers can contact us about their data.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0 12px;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.6;">We collect information you provide when registering, booking tickets, making payments, or contacting support, including:</p>
    <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
        <li>Name, email address, and phone number</li>
        <li>Passenger names and selected seats</li>
        <li>Booking, route, travel date, and payment records</li>
        <li>Basic device and usage information needed for security and troubleshooting</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0 12px;">2. How We Use Information</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.6;">We use this information to:</p>
    <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
        <li>Create accounts and authenticate customers</li>
        <li>Process bookings, payments, cancellations, and refunds</li>
        <li>Send service updates and respond to support requests</li>
        <li>Improve route planning, customer service, and system security</li>
        <li>Comply with applicable Cambodian legal requirements</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0 12px;">3. Sharing Information</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
        We do not sell personal information. We may share only what is necessary with payment providers, communication providers, operating staff, and legal authorities when required.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0 12px;">4. Data Security</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
        We use access controls, authentication, and operational safeguards to reduce unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or loss of customer information.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0 12px;">5. Your Choices</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.6;">Customers may request help to:</p>
    <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
        <li>Review or update account information</li>
        <li>Ask about booking and payment records</li>
        <li>Request account deletion where legally permitted</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0 12px;">6. Contact</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
        For privacy questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:lazy168@gmail.com">lazy168@gmail.com</a> or call 012 345 678.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top: 24px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">Last updated: May 2026</p>
</section>
